### Device prefs — digest / nudge / entitlement / events / plans
### Tất cả cần device auth (X-Device-ID + X-Device-Token)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId =
@deviceToken =
@planId = REPLACE_WITH_PLAN_UUID
@followToken = REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOW_TOKEN
@spotId = REPLACE_WITH_SPOT_UUID

### --- Weekly digest ---
### spotIds: các spot muốn nhận digest tuần
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/digest
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotIds": ["{{spotId}}"],
  "enabled": true
}

GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/digest
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/digest
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

### --- Good-day nudge (push "hôm nay đẹp trời đi picnic") ---
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/nudge
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "consent": "granted",
  "sendHour": 8,
  "home": { "lat": 10.77, "lng": 106.70, "source": "manual" }
}

GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/nudge
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

### --- Entitlement (Free/Plus) ---
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/entitlement
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

### Link giao dịch App Store (signedTransaction từ StoreKit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/entitlement/link
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "signedTransaction": "REPLACE_WITH_JWS"
}

### --- Analytics events ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/events
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    { "name": "spot_view", "props": { "spotId": "{{spotId}}" } }
  ]
}

### --- Plans (lịch hẹn picnic, server-stored) ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/plans
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotId": "{{spotId}}",
  "start": "2026-11-21T09:00:00+07:00",
  "end": "2026-11-21T12:00:00+07:00",
  "tz": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/plans
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/plans/{{planId}}
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

### Follow plan của người khác bằng token (share link /p/:token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/plan-follows/{{followToken}}
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

### Public: xem plan được share (không cần auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/shared-plans/{{followToken}}
